# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the tp4/packed-prefix development window (sticky sessions on the eight-seat 262k packed path;
# scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/packed-prefix and push a tag
# experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a registry: the cards are resolved at run time. The jobs are templates only: no tag is
# pushed from this branch by its author.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-packed-prefix-1 is what B0 builds from the pushed tp4/packed-prefix commit; every later job serves that one image. A commit of a
# file the image carries needs a new B0 build and a new tag in every template. The cards are under development: this window never stops, starts or hands back the node agent.
# B0 (no card opened): build the window image tp4-packed-prefix-1 from the pushed tp4/packed-prefix commit. The profile named is the production default; nothing is baked as the image default
# (no C2_BAKE_DEFAULT_PROFILE), so the image default stays qwen_c2_profiles.json's c2-packed-tp4. THE TAG MUST BE FRESH: the build step skips a tag that already exists.
# THE 262k EVIDENCE WAIVER: the 262k evidence records are pending skeletons, so every arm of this window runs a gate-only profile carrying QWEN_FAST_262K_EVIDENCE_WAIVER=1: every result is
# UNQUALIFIED, a measurement and never evidence; no traffic profile of sticky sessions exists yet. No privileged builder container may be up.
# THE IMAGE MUST CARRY THE PREFIX STAGE: the build applies qwen_prefix_stage (the scheduler, runner and model grafts) and the new modules are in both image copy lists and the overlay.
# READ: the build log's provenance report with no problem line, the closure checks pass (including test_tp4_packed_prefix_profiles and the prefix image closure), the image id printed.
# Never run it during a timing job. Duration (estimate): 20-60 min. Stop rule: a build or provenance failure stops the window.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=build
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-packed-prefix-1
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4
